#: app/components/Services.tsx#Services
msgid ""
"When a web application has become hard to change, we review the architecture "
"with your team, make tradeoffs visible, and help implement the next step in "
"React and TypeScript. You get a target picture, a reasoned decision, and a "
"migration path the team can carry."
msgstr ""
